 Darkwind Heroes
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 Attaining Hero status on Darkwind is mostly a
 status symbol at the moment. To earn the title
 of Hero, you must reach level 45. Players that
 have reached this status will have [HERO] in place
 of their level on the who list.

 Currently, the only benefit given to a Hero
 other then prestige, is the ability to change
 their title at will with the 'ltitle' command.
